### login (guarda o token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "usuario@upf.br", "password": "abc123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### buscar alimentos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/foods?search=arroz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### alimentos parecidos (id 145 = pão integral de forma, 50 g)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/foods/145/similar?grams=50&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### erros: 404 (id inexistente), 400 (grams inválido)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/foods/99999/similar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/foods/145/similar?grams=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
